\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6f9372f7-c3eb-4b9d-be9e-2e32730244c2\">영상에 나온 전체 음식 값의 합은 우리나라 돈으로 약 2만 6천원 정도인데요. 물가가 정말 싸더라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-548c2534-f66d-4729-a777-cabdc0cfe5f1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8aea2a9f-cf75-4068-827c-55af5f048922\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7e9f0b94-dcf3-4168-8cd8-94cb43b824ff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a7e1a18e-d37d-4c7f-8d90-2f7f6e2f0378\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d275572-a8bb-4cdd-9465-03507b36c832\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5d77c6f0-2fb7-4745-a544-43ae2aecf02b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2dea3e9a-77f0-492a-baed-a83cea065485\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-48b98ea7-e118-4931-af55-a734c8acbb2e\">돈을 쓸수록 이런 생각이 들었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-db401953-9a48-4749-a04b-0d0869d6b9f0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-46d8c884-4fbb-4805-8ea0-9a8258306fe2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9ec01ca8-513d-416e-ab8e-a2a223440013\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d0dc211a-5e84-4539-a144-7a467902277e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-508587f2-3a24-4716-8f09-dcb182efecd1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cda2ff3e-50bc-4516-a951-32574976fc3b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ddd8170d-da55-4ae8-8488-c42a535ed8b3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8e35024a-2f17-4110-8adf-085d1a6b0bdc\">돈의 가치가 다르구나. 실제 제 돈은 변한게 없습니다. 제 통장에 있는 돈은 여행 전과 후 똑같아요. 근데 제가 누릴 수 있는게 다르더라구요. 돈의 가치가 달라졌으니까요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e9aa69ba-01e2-4bfd-85ed-5c93568dc3eb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-175a9a5e-b4ee-4c02-bc78-4e0c043c9daa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-645da457-b03e-4987-9047-735d22d69d55\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d260ea64-c9c0-4f3a-96c7-aeb6f4812d8b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-imageStrip se-imageStrip2 se-l-default\" id=\"SE-9509424f-8249-4c87-b542-8e9becf08bcd\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-imageStrip se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-imageStrip-container se-imageStrip-col-2\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"width:48.94610412080059%;\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-043fcef4-d7b2-406e-a839-e3fd6526c94f\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMjAg/MDAxNzA3NzE4MzkzMjEw.rTGivpFvT65U48sUAwWgmKnQjgDYoHdAH1GD6Kk7ckcg.NfbG109yGEy8Gt7lYVFZ2ND4KRFKGy5syzO9RmKDP3Yg.JPEG/KakaoTalk_20240207_214545119_04.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"3024\", \"originalHeight\" : \"4032\", \"linkUse\" : \"fa