SE-7cf38ae5-6a9e-407e-b26d-5f37ed40b18d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a61de972-cca0-4fe5-ba68-b37120f3339f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27102c3a-91e7-4692-b846-ec96310ee585\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-09572aa5-08be-4c58-861b-3bcaef1ee736\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-29f8bff1-dcf9-49c9-a37c-a330bcf79f3b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-15a34d78-c814-4ac4-959e-2603c2eaf004\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70c89604-4094-4796-9606-af03a58ec1b0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4f43e596-0ae8-49f9-a6ba-350c46c06e71\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cd2fd16d-e0b8-4297-8b75-7443aa32aa40\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3cc2051b-a02a-4bbd-a3aa-c1bc5f871f12\">당연한 말인가요? 근데 이 원리를 &#x27;어떻게&#x27; 활용하느냐에 따라 아주 쉽게 내 몸 값을 올릴 수 있습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a6f3a67-63d8-4e75-982d-5f3045587bdb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1f535e8e-1f11-4617-a850-f2bb5780b57d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c192e62d-e36d-47a1-84e6-9134e648583d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5b963a36-bf64-44fe-935f-206ef74d6ad6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7bf0b63c-4b48-4290-8836-d5efac45b773\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5874b7e4-ca31-4c01-abdf-adbe865db604\">물가 싼 나라에 가면 좋은게 있습니다. 먹고 싶은걸 마음대로 먹을 수 있죠. 집보다 훨씬 좋은 곳에서 묵을수도 있구요. 마사지도 실컷 받을 수 있습니다. 실제로 저는 하루에 2번씩 받았습니다. 4박 6일간 총 7번을 받았습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-821db186-f15c-4ee6-9a35-ded131e171f6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-912e7cdb-86e1-47a4-b923-764ee8aebd47\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b2cc18c-2708-4a65-8a98-7510dc92e1a2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4380900c-6dc6-481d-8661-d0076c9682c4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c8f86e7b-6c36-4d5d-8ce0-100c84a3fed0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3d276a11-8f5d-4558-8dd0-dbbcd67edd66\">내가 어디에 있느냐에 따라 내가 가진 것에 대한 가치가 다른거죠</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-275ece06-f7aa-44b9-a9ce-91e0763b3021\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-42aca1fc-65f0-43db-bf5d-b04e882e3547\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4d1c0ce-9191-4210-9e0b-715fb59ceb65\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a2332f22-6820-4fed-86d7-b3867559651d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b1d0f4d0-1ac4-4342-9dfa-7487ed182ddd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6a5b4680-7d96-40a8-ba56-66c3850dc398\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ea629eb1-0f24-4068-a087-d32b314886cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8338e91f-40ae-4d67-be36-a6678e48a1f4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-810fcc03-8ddd-42b9-834a-7a0067a01495\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6b95b236-c27d-40c7-b659-f5e027cc15e7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-164a1396-35d9-4cf8-8125-60fe21a6b244\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e11407d0-2e3a-457a-aa65-ab45950af1c0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a27d3100-1a1a-4157-b817-44017fd55b75\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4f0d2bb0-d103-4f5b-8929-9757152e758d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1e273311-f3ce-411b-857f-c6e9f2fc7e1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-db1a2f5a-a883-4d8e-8749-faf7cd189a16\">활용해보면 이렇습니다. 내가 가진 것을 크게 2가지로 나눠보겠습니다. 돈과 시간. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d99767c-d949-461c-8e58-a34d719a8e50\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-990fc4a6-5cf7-49eb-839a-41f17fd45ca1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bfc81d97-d6dd-4658-a0d8-80d8ade29e32\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9d5292c3-8a88-402c-a051-769bd45a80b2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a4e86eb3-3789-4929-b5bf-35039397b161\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e04d4458-c362-4ab9-94d1-323fdf9028fa\">돈의 가치가 높은 곳에서는 차라리 돈을 쓰고 시간을 적게 쓰는게 좋습니다. 시간의 가치가 높은 곳에서는 돈을 적게 쓰고 시간을 많이 쓰는게 좋죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5984a2a3-353e-43a4-9c5c-b61ae9a52dc4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dc605d38-1120-45a5-877b-ce526d39db5e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-695eb160-e258-4469-8c9b-f5742dc45d2f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d87bee2b-9c9d-4f78-be0a-c413c7bae761\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-94d6b6d8-fee6-4fdb-a39f-d7639df36c92\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7d0456b8-beb1-488d-8b60-50623dab9ac5\">대표적인 예시가 외국인 노동자 입니다. 자신의 나라보다 물가가 더 비싼 나라에 가서 일을 하고, 번 돈을 자기나라로 보냈을 때 가장 효율적이니까요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-02a63e97-fb29-418f-8ddf-86d61a990482\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b1f48333-f6fc-444c-8189-b7e051e3898e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6888dda-5b0a-482f-95de-6a7b9e74fb37\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e9ff7c7e-0f60-405b-bea1-3f40cbdda971\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b6bf87c-d3af-4616-9397-03f5019d6ba7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0bd1e54e-e354-4f4e-805d-7798115d471f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-80336a20-55a0-4ca4-9cde-7d3104f01bbd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9bfc251d-dbb0-422b-82e9-e14718c6ccd0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e11426c-a44b-4beb-b84a-07ea1fd8113c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-aff91872-3f97-466c-a2d3-b4a550818bf4\">근데 만약 한국 사람이 베트남 가서 알바를 한다면 어떨까요? </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-01c68ca3-1e6a-4ac7-9a84-5279ae16353d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d0f6b36d-5236-49f8-84cf-9e2bbc246d53\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9cc1f0a2-d21d-4ff8-af81-8ebdbadf166c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d13dfb76-d6a4-4127-b048-a8667bf4819e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7c49269f-45ae-436d-8979-c2db689adce0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8863ea14-1afc-4601-99bc-aeb67e98b554\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13a704bd-22da-41a8-a42e-320684af4f09\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-57d83cbb-7465-431c-be16-d722a780e0e4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c9b7317-ff34-48b4-97ab-46efdd50099f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-816cd006-8513-4ae3-9072-17604af63fe5\">주위에서 호주 워킹홀리데이를 간다는 말은 들어봤어도, 베트남 워킹홀리데이 라는 말은 못 들어보셨을겁니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d5decd4a-5923-4372-b4ce-dac7e42b6049\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-d5decd4a-5923-4372-b4ce-dac7e42b6049\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTc5/MDAxNzA3NzIyMzkyMjQy.d2rwfxVSLu8_VVe66Tr6FSr8Ayo-f1WL91HvqFCoyRsg.nEovS89zbYN96OGd8W2Q-rmIm8Z__SYH36DulBHs4igg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"4000\", \"originalHeight\" : \"2252\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTc5/MDAxNzA3NzIyMzkyMjQy.d2rwfxVSLu8_VVe66Tr6FSr8Ayo-f1WL91HvqFCoyRsg.nEovS89zbYN96OGd8W2Q-rmIm8Z__SYH36DulBHs4igg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-5663c62b-f069-4fd7-956a-e57b89b0c17d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a2e8fcc2-d07f-4721-82e3-62c7aa4a8375\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-91533ff1-ab7c-4faf-8f0e-3ca798776215\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5b7a1fb1-88bf-41f2-8da5-57f85c72d42e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a3245ddc-2506-488b-97b8-4ab54fbf9d78\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-51296b1c-56fc-4c6d-b69a-b1d32e0483ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5a8e5652-f600-4ffa-bfad-d938949a6c24\">근데 어쩌면 우리가 그렇게 살고 있는지 모릅니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-105132da-2091-4f34-9930-b5202264f6b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-717db16b-9e75-4a40-b077-ee851031fbf5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ebf47cc1-2fa2-4e58-8c2b-cfa44330f2d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f9eb9254-df1d-4c03-8c1b-5418505836ab\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-32c37bda-c3b7-43eb-af3c-dfae274486b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-63ace7a8-4dd7-4632-9bb8-315904f2ac9f\">회사에서 일을 열심히 하고 오면 힘들죠. 그럼 블로그고 뭐고 그냥 눕기 바쁩니다. 월급 루팡을 하라는건 아니지만, 회사에서 모든 에너지를 다 써버리면 어떨까요? 마치 베트남 워킹홀리데이를 하는 것과 같습니다. 회사에서 바라보는 내 시간의 가치는 아마 최저시급도 안되니까요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f55e14f4-404a-44e4-9684-1c7e1f24341b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-508f8766-e594-4aec-9379-597de0d7fc98\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-85fd777e-2b13-47a5-8743-8950f518083f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c37899dd-9892-42f7-b964-6b378cce6405\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6a1295da-24da-4fa2-b0f2-7924a739464b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2de188dd-1879-46ac-b7df-66af9585c355\">며칠전 인스타 릴스에 &#x27;나이대별 평균 연봉&#x27;영상을 올렸습니다. 조회수가 72만회가 나왔는데요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5fafb01e-b63b-49a0-a986-6e262f8f27fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-aab14c9b-5125-4b2f-8690-8d3de77ced89\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e0c112a-f179-4c0e-a8f4-3151b55ba56e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b7bcaaea-ea6d-402e-9f5a-a61cdfe0b3b4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-81620ba9-eb6d-4d6f-afaf-8bc97d1efacb\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:466px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-81620ba9-eb6d-4d6f-afaf-8bc97d1efacb\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTE3/MDAxNzA3NzIxNTU0MjQ5.fhtc13PSoCIt9I1He6qiwp4-ppSmkiNB3O0JYcozgOsg.wV1uQpafwVZdkyZziOODAZpUPEQLnOA9GSgnJV9HGowg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"466\", \"originalHeight\" : \"819\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTE3/MDAxNzA3NzIxNTU0MjQ5.fhtc13PSoCIt9I1He6qiwp4-ppSmkiNB3O0JYcozgOsg.wV1uQpafwVZdkyZziOODAZpUPEQLnOA9GSgnJV9HGowg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-63b13845-b830-4b00-a2ac-6fe1fcf03c20\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9098aa73-c62d-4a6e-abfd-ac7f1939cf1f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3de7cbe6-2d25-416f-9ff4-3d8350a5db20\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-baf2b027-ecc9-419a-8bb7-399d7f272d2d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-312d0285-982a-4540-be27-234d260bac8a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dcd6e705-e562-46fe-831f-6cd73f00f035\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e9b3672f-68a5-403b-a067-87330a2bd2f9\">덕분에 댓글에는 욕이 꽤나 있었습니다. 나는 평균도 안되는 인간이다. 이게 평균이 맞냐. 평균을 운운하는 너는 평균이냐. 세전이냐 세후냐 등등이요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a7888b2-5975-44b3-b33e-77bd230dab75\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d4cce044-73be-4ae1-a2a0-4aef110e4339\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bd0491e8-eafd-4505-9b23-b5dbd02cc769\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-585a8319-570a-4c89-920e-28edd99f1d53\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5090121b-74e7-4aa8-99ae-b497f7111ee3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-aa19d9a1-2508-4c7a-82bb-3d3c53e70ad9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ccf94aaf-8256-4210-a3b2-9142b30741e5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-af8534d5-2976-45b8-b3b4-9532870110f9\">그럴 수 밖에 없죠. 평균연봉을 보면 꽤나 높은 편인데요. 현실은 그렇지 못한 경우가 많습니다. 최저시급도 못 받죠. 저 통계에는 내 시간의 값어치를 당당히 인정 받고 있는 사람들이 포함되어있거든요. 그래서 내 시간의 가치를 제대로 인정 받지 못하고 있다면 화가 날 수 밖에 없는거죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b8652c6-f22b-43b0-a5af-643cc958af4e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a0ce9cc5-de0c-4ad6-a85d-9b341e1e77cf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4fac377-5153-4a0c-9ee8-d03cd1a7ae52\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9efc878e-6deb-4042-b202-852a88ad38e9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-446d3862-c26f-480f-8a64-a97f87f2b6a0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-32ac8914-7988-4d49-833d-be7633fe28c5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-11d8a952-b258-4535-9c20-d59f81c6e448\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-126d836a-c51b-4fa7-a444-de0677a84ff1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27142b84-e740-4146-92f6-daad6710589d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-222d9a3a-7f38-49a4-9c16-72a33d8dff55\">근데 만약 같은 시간을 회사 밖에서 쓴다면 어떨까요? </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-42de8e79-9631-4ecd-9ed2-b697dbe4eb06\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-604d5b0c-9d87-4586-8540-b30d62f13e92\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-079e95cc-a4ab-4d39-b4e4-a80a5f83cfe1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d4a55362-ba48-4c77-9e6e-08130b324173\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7655ce66-412c-4807-9f4d-1edb9a62d090\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1645c9fe-2832-4c59-bf9e-2be66ae32453\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a1e4e1fa-121b-4a37-a727-38104191868e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd0292e3-d337-472b-874e-f479e456ec64\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-33832557-fca6-42be-ab5f-deb073507903\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-be4431ed-e0a3-4070-8f0c-70e926a35e14\">시간의 가치는 달라집니다. 회사에 있는 1시간과 집에서 부업한다고 글을 쓰는 1시간의 가치가 다르다는 겁니다. 근데 이상하게 우리는 야근은 밥 먹듯이 하면서 글쓰는 1시간을 내는걸 더 어려워 합니다. 보통 이런 분들이 하는 핑계가 의지가 없다고 하시는데요. 의지의 문제가 아닙니다. 시간의 가치가 다르다는걸 몰라서 그런거죠.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-71f9f18e-348d-4ee8-8353-561a1cab84ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2f84d99b-86eb-4b51-9641-2d81b3b1e0b6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6921ccb9-dfbd-4282-b2bf-5af3e0e3a7d0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f84d9aac-8754-4640-8411-e587c545d381\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-336a603b-b04e-4fe5-9bae-46d400b1f4d4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-01ff27af-5ea4-42c4-851d-702fa3faa9ac\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1ccd1376-3ee4-4fce-a7e2-ee33e894debb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-add1de7d-4950-4ec5-b3da-69b9fda594bf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-41265d7e-83d9-4c5e-bbf5-04e2a0eab96e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-62d4537d-8dc9-45bc-acc8-64a0b141e7b9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-92ba94cd-a0e0-4b37-89ce-8ad22abe39f1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-89981f46-d642-4c2f-be38-7fa7121b64e4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e99baf6-d7fb-41db-9d0c-54a8f3b31ae7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dc5fcc2f-5f86-424b-a6f8-604788f9e7f0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4617e4f6-cee9-46e4-ae83-2cb2ae71f50e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-982d79aa-9c05-46ac-86c4-9c857a56f73d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c005a5ff-da0e-48b8-9bb9-88e811c45f87\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b5a183d0-13f7-4c7d-ba78-51ec8ca39b76\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f47c996c-de5f-4f1f-aa02-eb9035b0f099\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-612d0c43-e8e9-4a41-8251-0b5437034f7c\">개인적으로 이 시간의 가치가 높은 분들을 보면 친해지고 싶어져요. 제가 정말 아끼는 분 중에 정화님이 계시는데요. 정말 정화님이야말로 시간의 가치가 굉장히 높아지신 분입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7329440d-a897-4871-a8d2-efee16d9491c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a60ec957-1efd-41db-b1e3-d390ae17f833\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8375f3dd-f9b2-442f-846a-41a3ce8b47e5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c0b399e5-b223-416f-a62d-dfa47c49bd5a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c36c939-db38-482e-bf65-00f1d23fe030\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-595989ef-5faa-4a10-b725-ad6e5bc1070a\">정화님은 4개월전 부업스파르타 2기 수강생이신데요. 원래는 여러 일을 하셨었어요. 하지만 한계를 느끼셨었죠. 그 와중에 부업스파르타반을 함께하게 되셨는데요. 부업스파르타반에서 시작한 청소업체를 창업한 이후로 최근 월 천만원 가까지 도달하셨다고 하네요. 정말 축하드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f7ea7964-609b-4cf2-848d-a97cf4f7a0f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-edb6a12d-50fd-407c-8dd3-1a96ea7672d2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-2b946e23-80dc-4f31-8f40-b5347d432e3e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-2b946e23-80dc-4f31-8f40-b5347d432e3e\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTA4/MDAxNzA3NzI0MzE5ODgx.1K1_Sdhm1I7avhx8AzR0e7NjBfHvl786yZQyK4FNb0Yg.tNqbVyY6B29b1BnzbsgCocZytsHUHRcqUUMxDRhU3sIg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1069\", \"originalHeight\" : \"303\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMTJfMTA4/MDAxNzA3NzI0MzE5ODgx.1K1_Sdhm1I7avhx8AzR0e7NjBfHvl786yZQyK4FNb0Yg.tNqbVyY6B29b1BnzbsgCocZytsHUHRcqUUMxDRhU3sIg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n         